## Minimal def schemas (v1)

### 0) Shared types

```ts
type Tier = "bronze" | "silver" | "gold" | "diamond";
type BoardLayer = "tile" | "card" | "permanent";

type EffectSpec = EffectOp | EffectOp[];

type TargetSpec =
  | { type: "at"; layer: BoardLayer; col: number }
  | { type: "self" }
  | { type: "under"; layer: "tile" | "permanent" }
  | { type: "sameCol"; layer: BoardLayer };
```

### 1) EnvTagDef (minimal)

Tags are *labels* used for gating + rule routing. No behaviors/affordances fields required yet.

```ts
type EnvTagDef = {
  id: string;          // "farmable"
  kind: "envTag";

  ui?: {
    name?: string;
    description?: string;
    icon?: string;
    color?: number;
  };
};
```

### 2) EnvSystemDef (this is where tiers live)

This replaces “player-facing numeric props”. Systems define:

* the tier ladder
* (optionally) UI copy/tooltips later
* (optionally) how tiers map to internal numbers later (but keep that out of defs for now if you want)

```ts
type EnvSystemDef = {
  id: string;          // "fertility" | "hydration" | "fishDensity" ...
  kind: "envSystem";

  ui?: {
    name?: string;
    description?: string;
  };

  defaultTier: Tier;   // you said: default everything to bronze
};
```

### 3) EnvTileDef (minimal, no props/tiers in defs)

Tiles only declare identity + season tables.

```ts
type WeightedTableEntry = {
  defId: string;
  weight: number;
};

type EnvTileDef = {
  id: string;          // "tile_floodplains"
  kind: "envTile";
  name: string;

  ui?: {
    shortName?: string;
    description?: string;
    icon?: string;
    color?: number;
  };

  // “Starts with no tag” is allowed (empty array).
  baseTags?: string[];

  // per-season generation source
  seasonTables: Record<string /* seasonKey */, WeightedTableEntry[]>;
};
```

### 4) EnvEventDef (your shape, trimmed)

* keep `class?: "effect" | "animal"` as a thin discriminator (it’s cheap and helps later)
* `tags?:` can be omitted for now unless you want UI filtering/search

```ts
type EnvEventDef = {
  id: string;              // "event_rain"
  kind: "envEvent";
  name: string;

  ui?: {
    shortName?: string;
    description?: string;
    icon?: string;
    color?: number;
  };

  class?: "effect" | "animal";

  defaultSpan?: number;    // >= 1

  durationSec?: number;    // if set => expiresSec = createdSec + durationSec
  expiresOnSeasonChange?: boolean;

  onEnter?: EffectSpec;
  onTick?: EffectSpec;     // once per second while unpaused
  onExit?: EffectSpec;
};
```

